<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-049" chapter-id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons" source-id="s-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons-ws2118585">
  <p id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">以廣固功，封永新縣男，食邑五百戶。遷給事中、太尉參軍事、龍驤將軍、高陽內史，領石頭戍事。高祖討<persName id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons:p001:m0047" ref="pcf_gg0_ena">司馬休之</persName>，前軍將軍<persName id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons:p001:m0056" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAB">道憐</persName>留鎮東府，領屯兵。冶亭羣盜數百夜襲<persName id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons:p001:m0075" ref="vcd_ee3_q63">鍾</persName>壘，距擊破之。時大軍外討，京邑擾懼，<persName id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons:p001:m0094" ref="vcd_ee3_q63">鍾</persName>以不能鎮遏，降號建威將軍。平蜀功，應封四百戶男，以先有封爵，減戶以賜次子<persName id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons:p001:m0131" ref="vcd_ee3_q63_B">敬順</persName>高昌縣男，食邑百戶。尋復本號龍驤將軍。十二年，高祖北伐，復留鎮居守，增其兵力，又命府置佐史。荊州刺史<persName id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons:p001:m0183" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAB">道憐</persName>獻名馬三匹，并精麗乘具，高祖悉以賜<persName id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons:p001:m0202" ref="vcd_ee3_q63">鍾</persName>三子。十四年，遷右衞將軍，龍驤將軍如故。元熙元年卒，時年四十三。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">子<persName id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons:p002:m0001" ref="vcd_ee3_q63_A">敬義</persName>嗣。<persName id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons:p002:m0005" ref="vcd_ee3_q63_A">敬義</persName>官至馬頭太守，卒。子<persName id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons:p002:m0017" ref="vcd_ee3_q63_AA">國重</persName>嗣，齊受禪，國除。<persName id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons:p002:m0028" ref="vcd_ee3_q63">鍾</persName>次子高昌男<persName id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons:p002:m0034" ref="vcd_ee3_q63_B">敬順</persName>，卒，子<persName id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons:p002:m0040" ref="vcd_ee3_q63_BA">國須</persName>嗣。<persName id="c-songshu-049-liu-zhong-sons:p002:m0044" ref="vcd_ee3_q63_BA">須</persName>卒，無子，國除。</p>
</text>
